"┌thndrs──────────────┐┌Transcript──────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│Sessions   ┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐           │"
"│ ● scratch │  Key          Action                                 │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"│           │  Enter        submit prompt / execute command        │           │"
"│           │  Esc          cancel stream / close overlay          │           │"
"│           │  Up/Down k/j  scroll transcript (empty input)        │           │"
"│           │  PgUp/PgDn    scroll by 10 lines                     │.d8888b    │"
"│           │  Ctrl+C       quit immediately                       │88K        │"
"│           │  Ctrl+D x2    quit (double-press within 3s)          │"Y8888b.   │"
"│           │                                                      │     X88   │"
"│           │  Command      Description                            │ 88888P'   │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"│           │  :            enter command mode                     │           │"
"│           │  ?            toggle this help overlay               │           │"
"│           │  /clear       clear the transcript                   │           │"
"│           │  /quit  /exit quit the app                           │           │"
"│           │  :help        show this help overlay                 │           │"
"│  ·  idle  │  :bg          list background processes              │           │"
